--   of official status, daily search volume, or completeness.
-- - pgvector <=> is cosine distance. <-> is L2 and is not mislabeled here.
-- - The current Booking UK catalog EPC is 9.35 (7d) / 11.15 (3m), not 328.20.
-- - A country header is a routing hint, never proof of timezone, residence,
--   humanity, buyer intent, or a legitimate click.
-- - This resolver returns data only. It never redirects, clicks, appends an
